flowchart LR
  Customer[Customer] --> Flutter[Untrusted Flutter client]
  Supplier[Supplier / Cook] --> Flutter
  Rider[Delivery Rider] --> Flutter
  Admin[Admin] --> Flutter
  Flutter --> Auth[Firebase Authentication]
  Flutter --> Rules[Firestore Security Rules]
  Rules --> Data[(Firestore)]
  Flutter --> Commands[Proposed trusted command service]
  Commands --> Authorization[Role / ownership / policy validation]
  Authorization --> Transaction[Transaction + audit + request receipt]
  Transaction --> Data
  Transaction --> Outbox[Committed notification intent]
  Outbox --> Sender[Trusted notification worker]
  Sender --> FCM[Firebase Cloud Messaging]
  FCM --> Flutter
